# Supabase CLI scratch state. Holds project link details and the cached CLI
# version; regenerated on demand and not useful to anyone else.
supabase/.temp/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEVER COMMIT A PRODUCTION DATA DUMP.
#
# baseline_data.sql was a 3.4 MB `pg_dump --data-only` of production. It carried
# real customer and vendor rows, KYC-related fields, and at least one uploaded
# photograph with its Samsung SEF/EXIF block intact -- including the GPS
# coordinates of a real person's neighbourhood. Committing it would publish all
# of that irreversibly, and rewriting history afterwards does not un-publish it.
#
# Dump SCHEMA ONLY. `supabase db dump` without `--data-only`, or
# `pg_dump --schema-only`. If you need row counts, ask the database for counts --
# do not pull the rows down to count them locally.
#
# This is a DPDP Act 2023 exposure as much as a security one.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
supabase/baseline_data.sql
supabase/*_data.sql
supabase/dump*.sql
supabase/**/baseline_data.sql
*.dump
